* {{sense|in a manner that is impossible to avoid}} {{l|en|evitably}}, {{l|en|avoidably}}, {{l|en|impossibly}}, {{l|en|incidentally}}
* {{sense|as usual}} {{l|en|unexpectedly}}, {{l|en|unusually}}

